[TITLE]
WaterStudio MSX fixture: longitudinal dispersion of a pulse

[OPTIONS]
SOLVER    RK5
TIMESTEP  60
RATE_UNITS HR
SEGMENTS  400
PECLET    1000000

[SPECIES]
BULK  TR   MG   0.001  0.001
BULK  CL2  MG   0.001  0.001

[COEFFICIENTS]
CONSTANT  kb  0.1

[PIPES]
RATE  TR   0
RATE  CL2  -kb*CL2

[SOURCES]
FLOW      J5  TR   10.0  Spike
SETPOINT  J3  CL2  0.8

[QUALITY]
NODE  W   CL2  1.0
GLOBAL    CL2  0.2

[PATTERNS]
Spike  1 0 0 0 0 0 0 0

[DIFFUSIVITY]
TR    1000.0
CL2   2.0e6   FIXED

[REPORT]
NODES   ALL
LINKS   1 2 3 4 5
SPECIES TR   YES  4
SPECIES CL2  YES  4
